  "human_edit_summary": "Round-1 remediation of all five Major findings. Declared the real dependency graph in every Blockers field (T-001 blocks all others; T-003 blocks T-002; T-002 blocks T-004; T-002 through T-005 block T-006; T-006 blocks T-007) and added a Lifecycle note recording that Blockers is authoritative for execution order while document order is not, since T-002 depends on T-003 despite appearing first (DEPENDENCY-COMPLETE, DEPENDENCY-OVERLAP). Replaced the unsatisfiable traceability Done-When item in all eight tasks with an implementation-report cross-reference naming the verification evidence paths, since traceability.md freezes when this gate passes and already carried the mapping (OBSERVABLE-DONE). Bounded T-007's Planned Files to the six explicitly named Node-core files instead of a glob, relying on the new T-006 blocker to sequence the hardening edits (SCOPE-DISJOINT). Added a Rollback field and a task-scoped rollback Done-When item to T-006 and T-007, both citing infra-spec.md Rollback (ROLLBACK-PLAN). Narrowed T-005's Scope so it no longer claims degraded-write coverage that AC-013 assigns to T-002. No other edit.",
